  "body_html": "<p>Следопыт, тебя сопровождает зверь, с которым ты сроднился и общаешься без слов. Считай его последователем.</p>\n<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"animal-companion\" data-hp-key=\"companion\" data-label=\"Animal Companion\">\n<h2 id=\"your-companion\">Твой спутник</h2>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Имя</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:name\" placeholder=\"name\" aria-label=\"имя\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-field\"><span class=\"fs-label\">Метки урона</span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:damage-tags\" placeholder=\"hand, …\" aria-label=\"вплотную, …\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div>\n<div class=\"fs-stats\"><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:max-hp\" data-default=\"5\" value=\"5\" aria-label=\"Макс. HP\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"1\" data-spin-max=\"99\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"99\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Макс. HP</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><span class=\"pb-spin\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:armor\" data-default=\"1\" value=\"1\" aria-label=\"Броня\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"numeric\" role=\"spinbutton\" data-spin-min=\"0\" data-spin-max=\"9\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"9\"><span class=\"pb-spin-btns\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▴</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-spin-step\" data-step=\"-1\" tabindex=\"-1\">▾</button></span></span><span class=\"pb-track-name\">Броня</span></div><div class=\"pb-track\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field pb-track-box\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:damage\" data-default=\"d4\" value=\"d4\" aria-label=\"Урон\" autocomplete=\"off\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"pb-track-name pb-roll\" data-roll-damage=\"d4\" title=\"Бросок урона\">Урон</button></div></div><div class=\"fs-hp-mount\"></div>\n<p class=\"fs-gloss\">Возьми Макс. HP, Броню и Урон из типа, который выберешь ниже (см. «Тип»).</p>\n<h3 id=\"type\">Тип</h3>\n<p>Выбери 1.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-type\">\n<div class=\"fs-type-head\"><label for=\"ac-type0-pick\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-type0-pick\" data-check-id=\"type0-pick\"> <strong>Птица</strong></label> <span class=\"fs-muted\">(сокол, орёл, сова, канюк, сорока, <input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type0-other\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"…\" autocomplete=\"off\">)</span></div>\n<p class=\"stat-line\">HP 5; Броня 1 (размер); Урон d4 (<em>вплотную</em>)</p>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">Выбери ещё 4:</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-0\" data-check-id=\"type0-0\"> <span>Улучшенный кубик урона (d6)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-1\" data-check-id=\"type0-1\"> <span>+4 HP</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-2\" data-check-id=\"type0-2\"> <span>+1 брони (проворство)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-3\" data-check-id=\"type0-3\"> <span><em>ловчая птица</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-4\" data-check-id=\"type0-4\"> <span><em>осторожная</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-5\" data-check-id=\"type0-5\"> <span><em>умная</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-6\" data-check-id=\"type0-6\"> <span><em>быстрая</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-7\" data-check-id=\"type0-7\"> <span><em>пересмешник</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-8\" data-check-id=\"type0-8\"> <span><em>зоркая</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-9\" data-check-id=\"type0-9\"> <span><em>скрытная</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-10\" data-check-id=\"type0-10\"> <span><em>вороватая</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"Отмечено с самого начала\"> <span><em>крохотная</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-12\" data-check-id=\"type0-12\"> <span><em>неутомимая</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type0-blank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type0-blank0\" data-check-id=\"type0-blank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type0-blank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"вписать своё\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n</div><div class=\"fs-type\">\n<div class=\"fs-type-head\"><label for=\"ac-type1-pick\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-type1-pick\" data-check-id=\"type1-pick\"> <strong>Зверёк</strong></la